# cx7: data is ":a :p :a ." Odd loop fires only at nodes without :p, so excluding the shapes graph decides
#
# From Appendix B of stable_semantics_plan.md; TestStableModels (stable_models_test.go) checks the same case
# and TestStableModelsFiles checks that this file matches it. Run it with
#   shawell -l -i -s resources/stable_models/cx7.ttl -m <semantics>
# Expected verdicts (exit codes):
#   well-founded     valid (0)
#   stable-brave     valid (0)
#   stable-cautious  valid (0)

@prefix : <http://example.org/> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

# data
:a :p :a .

# shapes
:U a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetNode :a ; sh:or ( [ sh:path :p ; sh:minCount 1 ] [ sh:not :U ] ) .

